mmand</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/brainstorm</code></td>\n<td>Structured brainstorming</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/create</code></td>\n<td>Create new application</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/debug</code></td>\n<td>Debug and troubleshoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/deploy</code></td>\n<td>Production deployment</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/enhance</code></td>\n<td>Add/update features</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/orchestrate</code></td>\n<td>Multi-agent coordination</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/plan</code></td>\n<td>Task planning</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/preview</code></td>\n<td>Preview server management</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/status</code></td>\n<td>Project status display</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/test</code></td>\n<td>Test generation and running</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">📚 Skills (35 Categories)</h2><a id=\"user-content--skills-35-categories\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📚 Skills (35 Categories)\" href=\"#-skills-35-categories\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Skills are organized in <code>~/.gemini/antigravity/skills/</code> and cover:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><